  "format": 1,
  "note": "Face registry. kind: standard (preset + approval in provenance/standard-expressions.json), derived, adult, corpse, domain. models: only for faces not selectable everywhere. frame_ticks: A frame owner of an A/_b animation, ticks per frame; frame_of: the B frame. open_mouth: swapped for teary_frown while the mouth holds an item. reserved: why a face with no emitter stays. Checked by scripts/check_face_registry.py.",
  "timing_basis": "项目设计：frame_ticks 逐帧给出时长（tick），与 frames 一一对应。含泪脸 A 帧是泪盈眼眶的停留，B 帧是泪溢出、泪珠顺脸颊流下的短帧：哭喊类 20/10，含泪类 28/12，睡中与虚弱 36/14，发冷 30/12；口水 24/16，哈欠 16/16，睡眠 20/20；激动漏尿流出时三帧各 4（身前尿线的高光逐帧下移），之后 30/10（底部挂着的最后一滴落下）。纯客户端循环。",
